        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "General procedure: a solution of lutetium nitrate (0.1 mmol) in acetonitrile (1 mL) was added dropwise to a solution of the corresponding 1,10-phenanthroline-2,9-dicarboxamide ligand (0.1 mmol) in chloroform (1 mL). The mixture was concentrated in vacuum to 1/10 of its initial volume and treated with diethyl ether (2 mL). The resulting complex was filtered, washed with ether, and dried in air. Single crystals were obtained by slow isothermal recrystallization from MeCN/CHCl3. Isolated as a white powder.",
